{"enemy":{"slug":"tri_maw","id":"enemy_1557_trcerb","name":"'Tri-Maw'","index":"DT","rank":"Boss","sort":1353,"hidden":false,"icon":"/enemies-icons/'Tri-Maw'.webp","flavour_text":"A giant hound with a rumbling tummy and three heads, each craving something different. Satisfy its picky palates to survive!","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attack_position":"Melee and Ranged","damage_type":["Physical","Arts"],"abilities":[{"text":"[Picky Palates] Clears all ingredients in the <Really Big Pot> at the start of each phase. Ingredients can only be added by defeating designated enemies. The current phase can be skipped by serving it a satisfying meal.","format":"normal"},{"text":"Upon reaching the <Really Big Pot> without being subdued, if meal is not ready, deduct 1 Life Point.","format":"normal"},{"text":"Takes less Physical and Arts damage based on the amount of ingredients in the <Really Big Pot>. The fewer ingredients there are, the less damage is taken.","format":"normal"},{"text":"Becomes enraged when HP drops below 50%, greatly increasing ATK and Movement Speed, and becoming immune to most control effects.","format":"normal"},{"text":"Forcibly adding special ingredients to the pot will cause it to get angry and refuse the meal, immediately enraging it and causing it to take less Physical and Arts damage.","format":"normal"},{"text":"'This One!'","format":"title"},{"text":"[Predation] After several attacks, the next attack deals increased Physical damage while lowering the target's DEF.","format":"normal"},{"text":"'That One!'","format":"title"},{"text":"[Howl of Hunger] Lets out an ear-splitting howl, stunning nearby allies and immediately waking all <Berry Slugs> and <Fruit Slugs> on the field.","format":"normal"},{"text":"'Chow Time!'","format":"title"},{"text":"[Flame of Gluttony] Shoots flames at a designated target, dealing increasing Arts damage over time. If the target leaves the field, triggers an explosion at the target's former location, dealing significant